flowchart TB
    Manual[Manual kickoff] --> Runtime
    Events[Schedule or Watchtower] --> Worktrees[Automation worktrees]
    Worktrees --> Runtime
    Config[Specialist profiles and runtime limits] --> Runtime

    Runtime[Anvil workflow runtime] --> Coordinator
    Coordinator --> A[Specialist A<br/>Provider, model, reasoning]
    Coordinator --> B[Specialist B<br/>Different provider or reasoning]
    B --> Nested[Optional nested specialist]
    Nested --> Handoffs
    A --> Handoffs
    B --> Handoffs

    Handoffs[Bounded handoffs with attempt references] --> Synthesis[Coordinator synthesis]
    Synthesis --> Review[Independent review or debate]
    Review --> Repair[Repair and verification]
    Repair --> Human{Human decision}
    Human -->|Accept and resume| Completed
    Human -->|Reject| Failed[Decision preserved]

    Runtime -. records .-> History[Graph changes, attempts, threads and events]
    Human -. records .-> History